window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Trapped in a Cursed Realm, Their Love Could Break the Chains—or Seal Their Fate.</b></p> <p>Niall MacTavish thought his heroic deeds would earn him peace, but saving a small Scottish village brought him only torment. Trapped for centuries in a sinister realm ruled by an evil wizard, Niall has accepted his grim fate. Bound by a dark curse and haunted by a demon that controls him in his sleep, escape is unthinkable—even when a fierce and beautiful stranger arrives with the power to set him free.</p> <p>Tammie Lockhart didn't expect her trip to Scotland to unravel all she's ever known. Discovering her own untapped powers, she's dragged into a realm of danger and magic, where she meets the brooding warrior bound by shadows. Niall claims he doesn't need saving, but Tammie sees through his defenses—and into his heart.</p> <p>As passion ignites between them, Tammie must confront an impossible choice: risk everything to break the wizard's curse, or lose the only man who has ever truly touched her soul.</p> <p>Will their love be the key to defeating the darkness, or will evil claim them both?</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
